===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# {{senseid|en|Q1147853}} A Mexican dish of [[cornmeal]] dough shell filled with various ingredients (e.g. chopped beef, pork, sweet filling) then steamed in corn [[husks]].
#: {{syn|en|humita|tamal}}

====Usage notes====
* The standard Spanish singular is {{m|es|tamal}}, and thus some proscribe '''''tamale''''' as an incorrect back-formation, preferring to use {{m|en|tamal}} as the English singular. The similarity of '''''tamale''''' to the ancestral Nahuatl {{m|nah|tamalli}} is not generally cited in support of the English usage of '''''tamale''''' as its spelling does not match with the Nahuatl spelling and the word originally entered via Spanish in the form of ''tamales''.

